x10668 text "Over a session of 10 edits, A0 (canonical) costs 184 tokens per task: place 12 of 49 (1 = fewest), cheaper than 36 of the other 48 languages, equal to 1, dearer than 11. A0 (dense, lean view with callee bodies) costs 117: place 1, cheaper than 48, equal to 0, dearer than 0."
x10669 puts x10667 x10668
